[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0765","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0765.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53500","title":"Thumbor ALLOWED_SOURCES 正则表达式未转义导致 SSRF 防护绕过漏洞","description":"Thumbor 是一款开源图片缩略图服务，其 ALLOWED_SOURCES 配置项用于限制 HTTP 加载器可获取图片的域名白名单。由于该配置将纯字符串模式直接传递给 re.match() 而未对点号进行转义，导致域名中的点号被解释为正则通配符，攻击者可通过构造仅在点号位置存在差异的恶意域名绕过白名单限制，实现 SSRF 攻击，从任意主机获取图片资源。该漏洞影响 Thumbor 7.8.0 之前所有版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。官方已在 7.8.0 版本中通过引入 re.escape() 修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53500","GHSA-6x26-6r6f-m537"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T19:17:09Z","updated":"2026-08-01T00:17:16Z","remediation":"立即升级 Thumbor 至 7.8.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade thumbor`），该版本已对 ALLOWED_SOURCES 中的纯字符串模式自动应用 re.escape()。如无法立即升级，将所有 ALLOWED_SOURCES 条目替换为预编译的正则表达式对象（如 `re.compile(r\"s\\.glbimg\\.com\")`），并设置 ALLOW_UNSAFE_URL=False 以限制用户直接传入图片 URL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/commit/68876715350c6c8f49c324e5515e64908830aed7","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/releases/tag/7.8.0","https://github.com/thumbor/thumbor/security/advisories/GHSA-6x26-6r6f-m537","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53500.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53500.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-53500.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53500.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53500.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-535xx/CVE-2026-53500.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/thumbor/CVE-2026-53500.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/61da2f38bd4a3618729c795f1eb30d756288e7b3/2026/CVE-2026-53500/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/61da2f38bd4a3618729c795f1eb30d756288e7b3/2026/CVE-2026-53500/README_KO.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0765.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0765.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0765.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0807","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0807.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55100","title":"Kyndryl hashi-vault-js 路径遍历与查询参数注入漏洞","description":"hashi-vault-js 库因未对标识符进行 URI 编码，导致路径遍历和查询参数注入漏洞。Vault.js 中所有标识符（名称、用户名、组、角色、版本等）直接拼接进 HTTP URL 而未调用 encodeURIComponent。攻击者可传入 `../../sys/seal` 作为密钥名实现路径遍历，访问管理接口；或传入 `1&list=true` 作为版本值注入额外查询参数。当应用将不可信用户输入作为 Vault 标识符传入库函数时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可重定向请求至非预期端点（含 sys/ 管理路径）或篡改查询逻辑，在应用使用的 Vault 令牌权限下执行操作。影响版本为 0.5.2 之前，建议升级至 0.5.2 或手动对输入进行 encodeURIComponent 编码缓解。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55100","GHSA-g956-2f74-rmv7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T18:17:17Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:16:51Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 hashi-vault-js 到 0.5.2 或更高版本（npm install hashi-vault-js@latest）。若暂时无法升级，必须在传入库函数前对所有用户输入（如 secret name、version、username 等）使用 encodeURIComponent() 进行严格编码，并增加输入校验禁止包含 ../、&、= 等特殊字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kyndryl-open-source/hashi-vault-js/commit/ea2f76052d366a08f35f62ef4c12b6a334c91ec2","https://github.com/kyndryl-open-source/hashi-vault-js/pull/66","https://github.com/kyndryl-open-source/hashi-vault-js/releases/tag/v0.5.2","https://github.com/kyndryl-open-source/hashi-vault-js/security/advisories/GHSA-g956-2f74-rmv7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55100.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0812ebe932b97710173c59d3d74959fb420956eb/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55100.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55100.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55100.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55100.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-551xx/CVE-2026-55100.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/npm/hashi-vault-js/CVE-2026-55100.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_3_CVE-2026-55100.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c40d15bc736663c338800597e967d5eaca965fc9/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-55100/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/e9f55b097256f05949a0f1dbecc8a1a5fe970fe7/content/posts/cve-2026-55100.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0807.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0798","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0798.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54737","title":"@phun-ky defaults-deep 原型污染漏洞","description":"@phun-ky/defaults-deep 是一个类似 lodash defaultsDeep 的 JavaScript 库，支持数组合并且无 lodash 依赖。在 2.0.5 版本之前，其 defaultsDeep() 函数在递归合并用户提供的对象时，未对 __proto__、constructor、prototype 等危险属性名进行过滤，导致攻击者可通过构造包含这些属性的恶意输入，将属性写入 Object.prototype，从而触发原型链污染。成功利用该漏洞可影响运行进程中所有对象，导致应用逻辑绕过、非预期行为甚至拒绝服务。攻击者无需身份认证，通过网络即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。建议升级至 2.0.5 或更高版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54737","GHSA-mj3g-7xcc-x4vh"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T18:17:17Z","updated":"2026-07-31T19:17:10Z","remediation":"立即将 @phun-ky/defaults-deep 升级至 2.0.5 或以上版本，该版本已过滤 __proto__、constructor、prototype 等危险键名。如无法升级，须在调用 defaultsDeep() 前递归清洗用户输入对象，移除所有层级的 __proto__、constructor、prototype 属性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/phun-ky/defaults-deep/commit/807dba930f8718f9126cad59d949b8fd3539b059","https://github.com/phun-ky/defaults-deep/pull/49","https://github.com/phun-ky/defaults-deep/releases/tag/2.0.5","https://github.com/phun-ky/defaults-deep/security/advisories/GHSA-mj3g-7xcc-x4vh","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54737.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54737.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54737.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54737.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54737.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54737.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_3_CVE-2026-54737.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/npm/@phun-ky/defaults-deep/CVE-2026-54737.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/e9f55b097256f05949a0f1dbecc8a1a5fe970fe7/content/posts/cve-2026-54737.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-54737.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0798.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0796","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0796.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54729","title":"dssrf DNS 解析绕过导致服务端请求伪造漏洞","description":"DSSRF 是一个 Node.js 库，提供 SSRF 防御检测功能。其 `is_url_safe` 函数在配置 1.1.1.1 作为 DNS 解析器时存在安全缺陷：当 1.1.1.1 返回 NXDOMAIN 时，`dns.resolve4` 不返回地址且未触发 `dns.lookup` 回退机制，导致 `localhost` 被误判为安全地址。攻击者可通过构造特定域名使 DNS 解析失败，绕过 SSRF 防护，向内网服务发起请求，造成服务器端请求伪造攻击。该漏洞影响 1.5.0 之前版本，已在 1.0.5 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54729","GHSA-5846-7qm3-r52j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T18:17:17Z","updated":"2026-07-31T18:17:17Z","remediation":"立即将 dssrf 升级到 1.0.5 或更高版本。该版本在 `resolve_all_records` 函数中增加了 `dns.lookup` 回退机制，当 `dns.resolve4` 返回空结果时通过 `dns.lookup` 二次解析，避免因 DNS 返回 NXDOMAIN 导致 SSRF 绕过。如无法立即升级，可在应用层强制将 `dns.setServers` 配置为支持 localhost 解析的 DNS 服务器，或在 SSRF 检测前额外校验目标主机名是否为内网地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/HackingRepo/dssrf-js/commit/668c21792cd1252baf779a176aa652e2b4c0067d","https://github.com/HackingRepo/dssrf-js/pull/102","https://github.com/HackingRepo/dssrf-js/security/advisories/GHSA-5846-7qm3-r52j","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54729.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54729.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54729.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54729.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54729.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/npm/dssrf/CVE-2026-54729.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54729.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54729.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c40d15bc736663c338800597e967d5eaca965fc9/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-54729/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/e9f55b097256f05949a0f1dbecc8a1a5fe970fe7/content/posts/cve-2026-54729.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0796.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0796.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0794","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0794.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54725","title":"Banzai Cloud vault-secrets-webhook 服务端请求伪造漏洞","description":"vault-secrets-webhook 是 Kubernetes 的变种准入 Webhook，用于将 Vault 密钥直接注入 Pod。在 1.23.1 版本之前，该组件的 `parseVaultConfig()` 函数（`pkg/webhook/config.go`）无条件读取 ConfigMap 或 Secret 中的 `vault.security.banzaicloud.io/vault-addr` 注解作为 Vault 服务器地址，未进行任何 URL 校验、域名白名单或内网地址过滤。当被准入的资源包含 `vault:` 前缀的值时，`MutateConfigMap` 和 `MutateSecret` 处理函数会在准入审查期间同步调用 `newVaultClient`，向攻击者控制的地址发起 HTTP 请求。同时，`vault.security.banzaicloud.io/vault-serviceaccount` 注解可触发 Webhook 利用集群级别的 `serviceaccounts/token:create` 权限，获取指定 ServiceAccount 的 JWT 令牌并发送至攻击者地址。攻击者只需在 Webhook 监视的命名空间中拥有 ConfigMap 或 Secret 的创建/更新权限，即可触发 Webhook 进程向任意外部地址（包括云元数据服务 IMDS）发起出站 HTTP 连接，并窃取 ServiceAccount JWT 令牌，进而重放至真实 Vault 服务器读取该 SA 角色授权的密钥。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.6，危害等级严重，已在 v1.23.1 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54725","GHSA-r2v3-8gwf-7ghm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T18:17:17Z","updated":"2026-07-31T19:17:10Z","remediation":"立即将 vault-secrets-webhook 升级至 v1.23.1 或更高版本，该版本在 parseVaultConfig() 中增加了 vault-addr 注解的 URL 校验和主机名白名单。如无法立即升级，可通过 OPA/Kyverno 准入策略禁止包含 vault.security.banzaicloud.io/vault-addr 注解的 ConfigMap/Secret 创建，并移除 ClusterRole 中 serviceaccounts/token:create 的集群级权限，仅授予必要命名空间。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bank-vaults/vault-secrets-webhook/commit/76db45976fee0f54cafd94dffa425e6b542f65a0","https://github.com/bank-vaults/vault-secrets-webhook/releases/tag/v1.23.1","https://github.com/bank-vaults/vault-secrets-webhook/security/advisories/GHSA-r2v3-8gwf-7ghm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54725.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54725.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54725.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54725.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54725.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54725.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_3_CVE-2026-54725.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/528b90295de0ca5af36b2156c19b7ce71d34644c/2026/CVE-2026-54725/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/528b90295de0ca5af36b2156c19b7ce71d34644c/2026/CVE-2026-54725/README_KO.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c40d15bc736663c338800597e967d5eaca965fc9/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-54725/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0794.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0794.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0794.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0791","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0791.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54707","title":"OnionShare OnionShare 文件上传限制绕过漏洞","description":"OnionShare 是一款基于 Tor 网络的安全匿名文件共享工具，其 2.6.3 及之前版本存在授权验证绕过漏洞。当接收方将服务配置为仅文本消息模式（启用 --disable-files 参数）时，远程攻击者仍可通过构造包含 file[] 字段的 multipart 表单请求绕过限制，将任意文件写入服务端接收目录。漏洞根源在于 ReceiveModeRequest._get_file_stream() 方法在底层流处理阶段未检查 disable_files 设置，导致文件在路由层跳过处理前已被写入磁盘。攻击者需知晓 OnionShare 服务地址，利用难度较低，可导致非预期文件写入和磁盘空间消耗，影响服务可用性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.4，已在 2.6.4 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54707","GHSA-v833-3823-cmhp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T17:16:33Z","updated":"2026-08-01T00:17:16Z","remediation":"立即将 OnionShare 升级至 2.6.4 或更高版本（https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare/releases/tag/v2.6.4），该版本在 ReceiveModeRequest._get_file_stream() 中增加了 disable_files 前置检查，阻止文件流写入磁盘。如无法升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则拦截含 file[] 字段的 multipart POST 请求到 /upload 和 /upload-ajax 路径，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare/commit/a090e97193efc91fbeac9dace7793ea568b83cf5","https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare/releases/tag/v2.6.4","https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare/security/advisories/GHSA-v833-3823-cmhp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54707.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54707.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54707.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54707.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-54707.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54707.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54707.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54707.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/onionshare-cli/CVE-2026-54707.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54707"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0791.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0791.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0791.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0790","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0790.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54706","title":"OnionShare OnionShare CLI/Desktop 符号链接跟随任意文件读取漏洞","description":"OnionShare CLI/Desktop 2.6.3 及之前版本中存在符号链接跟随漏洞。当用户共享一个包含攻击者提供的或不可信的符号链接的目录时，SendBaseModeWeb.set_file_info() 和 stream_individual_file() 函数在处理文件索引和流式传输时未拒绝符号链接，导致远程接收方可通过 Website 模式、Share 单文件下载模式或默认 ZIP 下载方式读取共享目录之外的本地文件。攻击者需要诱导 OnionShare 用户共享包含恶意符号链接的目录，并获取 OnionShare 服务地址，即可窃取 SSH 密钥、浏览器数据、钱包文件等敏感信息。该漏洞已在 2.6.4 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54706","GHSA-22p9-r2f5-22mf"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T17:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-31T19:17:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 OnionShare 至 2.6.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复符号链接跟随问题。如无法立即升级，在共享目录前手动检查并移除所有符号链接文件，避免共享包含不可信来源文件的目录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare/commit/48f31cfac077fcc9c04c67c2a6dbf87d956f5eec","https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare/releases/tag/v2.6.4","https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare/security/advisories/GHSA-22p9-r2f5-22mf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54706.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54706.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54706.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54706.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-54706.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54706.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54706.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54706.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/onionshare-cli/CVE-2026-54706.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54706"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0790.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0790.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0790.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0761","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0761.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52856","title":"Pterodactyl Wings SFTP 握手拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pterodactyl Wings 服务器控制面板的 SFTP 连接握手过程中存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-129），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统开放的 SFTP 端口发送特制的恶意数据包，触发 Go 语言运行时 panic 导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有开启了 SFTP 端口的 Wings 用户，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 1.13.0 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级或关闭 SFTP 端口作为临时缓解措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52856","GHSA-ghrq-5wpp-hxx5"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T17:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-31T19:17:09Z","remediation":"立即将 Pterodactyl Wings 升级至 v1.13.0 或更高版本（https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/releases/tag/v1.13.0），该版本已修复 SFTP 握手阶段畸形包导致的 Go panic 问题。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面关闭 SFTP 端口（默认 22）作为临时缓解措施，或限制可访问 SFTP 端口的源 IP 范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/commit/8e49c7c0eda815d3ada171831876a1c14c493026","https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/releases/tag/v1.13.0","https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/security/advisories/GHSA-ghrq-5wpp-hxx5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52856.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52856.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-52856.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-52856.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-52856.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-528xx/CVE-2026-52856.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_2_CVE-2026-52856.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/go/github.com/pterodactyl/wings/CVE-2026-52856.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-52856.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-52856.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0761.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0760","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0760.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52855","title":"Pterodactyl Wings 守护进程配置模板注入致敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Pterodactyl Wings 服务端控制面板的 egg 配置文件模板引擎存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。低权限用户（如服务器所有者或具有 startup.update 权限的子用户）可在 egg 变量值中注入 `{{config.*}}` 占位符，当 Panel 将用户可控的变量值发送至 Wings 渲染配置文件时，该占位符会被解析为完整的守护进程配置，导致节点 daemon token、token_id 及 Docker 容器注册表凭据等敏感信息被写入用户服务器文件并可被读取。攻击者利用泄露的 daemon token 可伪造认证令牌，进而完全控制该节点上的所有服务器，实现从低权限账户到整节点沦陷的权限提升。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.9，危害等级严重，影响所有使用用户可编辑 egg 变量的多租户/共享托管部署环境。Wings v1.12.3 版本已修复此问题，修复后模板引擎仅暴露非敏感的网络接口配置子集。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52855","GHSA-pfvc-3p5h-x7h6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T17:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:16:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Wings 升级至 v1.12.3 或更高版本；升级后进入管理后台 Nodes → Configuration，重置受影响节点的 daemon token 并重新部署 config.yml 至节点。如无法立即升级，审计所有 egg 配置，确保无用户可编辑变量被渲染到配置文件中，或将该类变量设为不可编辑。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/commit/eb65e27ae077a63e38518c490768486af1cd86a9","https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/releases/tag/v1.12.3","https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/security/advisories/GHSA-pfvc-3p5h-x7h6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52855.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52855.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-52855.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-52855.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-52855.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-528xx/CVE-2026-52855.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-31/TIER_3_CVE-2026-52855.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/432c275843bcf37499a083c1039676391c58f696/2026/CVE-2026-52855/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/432c275843bcf37499a083c1039676391c58f696/2026/CVE-2026-52855/README_KO.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/go/github.com/pterodactyl/wings/CVE-2026-52855.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0760.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0760.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0762","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0762.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52857","title":"Pterodactyl Wings 配置文件解析资源耗尽漏洞","description":"Pterodactyl Wings 游戏服务器管理面板的配置文件解析器存在不受控制的资源消耗漏洞（CWE-400）。parser.go 中的 JSON、YAML、XML 等配置文件解析器未对文件大小进行限制或校验，拥有本地低权限的攻击者或运维人员可通过创建或上传一个超大的非 file 类型解析配置文件，导致 Wings 进程在解析该文件时耗尽内存（OOM），造成服务拒绝。该漏洞影响所有使用非 file 解析器配置的 egg 用户，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。官方已在 1.13.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52857","GHSA-q6hh-gp44-4hcm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T16:17:06Z","updated":"2026-07-31T17:16:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 Wings 至 v1.13.0 或更高版本，该版本已对配置文件解析器添加文件大小限制。如无法立即升级，可在所有 egg 配置中将非 `file` 类型的解析器（json/yaml/xml）改为 `file` 类型，避免直接解析用户上传的配置文件内容；同时在系统层面通过 cgroups 或 systemd 的 `MemoryMax` 限制 wings 进程的最大内存使用量，防止 OOM 导致服务中断。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/commit/5f71f65711b6b9e6f913bec94a7b36d9a5eaae49","https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/releases/tag/v1.13.0","https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/security/advisories/GHSA-q6hh-gp44-4hcm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52857.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52857.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-52857.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-52857.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-52857.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-528xx/CVE-2026-52857.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/go/github.com/pterodactyl/wings/CVE-2026-52857.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-52857.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-52857.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8b136ad0f9c6a3aaf75bfb273a0e3f34c40c3fb/2026/CVE-2026-52857.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0762.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0910","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0910.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-62323","title":"Cloudreve WOPI 会话鉴权绕过漏洞","description":"Cloudreve 是一款自托管的文件管理与分享系统，其 WOPI 集成存在授权验证缺陷。WOPI 访问令牌生成格式为 `<会话ID>.<随机密钥>`，但中间件 `ViewerSessionValidation` 仅验证会话 ID 前缀，未将完整令牌与存储值进行比对，导致任意后缀均可通过验证。同时，创建查看会话时指定的 `preferred_action`（如 view）未被持久化存储或强制执行，查看会话仍可调用 WOPI 写入接口。具有低权限的攻击者若能够获取或猜测有效会话 ID，即可伪造令牌后缀，通过查看会话对目标文件执行写入操作，造成机密性降低与完整性破坏。该漏洞影响 Cloudreve 4.17.0 之前版本，已在 4.17.0 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-62323","GHSA-c3jm-gv5r-9wcp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-31T04:17:24Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:16:53Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cloudreve 至 v4.17.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 WOPI 中间件未校验完整 access_token 及未限制视图会话写入权限的问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 `/api/v4/file/wopi/` 路径添加访问控制，仅允许受信任的 WOPI 客户端 IP 访问，并禁用 WOPI 集成中的写操作路由作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cloudreve/cloudreve/commit/f3347130ac48f2ff996af9ef66c97be2dda9cba9","https://github.com/cloudreve/cloudreve/releases/tag/4.17.0","https://github.com/cloudreve/cloudreve/security/advisories/GHSA-c3jm-gv5r-9wcp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2026/62xxx/CVE-2026-62323.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2026/62xxx/CVE-2026-62323.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-62323.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-62323.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-62323.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-62323.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-623xx/CVE-2026-62323.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-62323.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v4/CVE-2026-62323.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/github.com/cloudreve/Cloudreve/v3/CVE-2026-62323.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0910.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0977","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0977.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-68501","title":"Sylius Mollie Plugin 未授权IDOR信息泄露漏洞","description":"Sylius Mollie Plugin 存在不安全的直接对象引用（IDOR）漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 /{_locale}/thank-you 和 /{_locale}/get-code 两个端点发送包含连续整数 orderId 的请求，绕过所有权与会话校验，获取订单 tokenValue，进而通过 /{_locale}/register-after-checkout/{tokenValue} 接口查看客户姓名和邮箱等敏感个人信息。该漏洞影响 Sylius Mollie Plugin 2.2.8 之前、3.2.4 之前及 3.3.1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-68501","GHSA-x83g-979r-f5fh"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-30T21:18:13Z","updated":"2026-07-31T16:17:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 Sylius Mollie Plugin 至 v2.2.8、v3.2.4 或 v3.3.1（根据主版本选择对应修复版本）。如无法立即升级，可通过装饰器模式在项目层对 `QrCodeAction` 和 `PageRedirectController` 两个控制器添加订单所有权校验：创建 `SecureQrCodeAction` 和 `SecurePageRedirectController` 装饰类，在 `config/services.yaml` 中注册为原服务的装饰器，然后执行 `bin/console cache:clear` 清除缓存。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/commit/01316b3ad3cf82e3c5ad160115d0a2cf89174e49","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/commit/153c754486b1bc597b67a90ac07ef71cd7958267","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/commit/d1f7753e92106e8bf3bedcfc61b02ea7b8e1c38a","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/pull/351","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/pull/352","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/pull/354","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/releases/tag/v2.2.8","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/releases/tag/v3.2.4","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/releases/tag/v3.3.1","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/security/advisories/GHSA-x83g-979r-f5fh","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2026/68xxx/CVE-2026-68501.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4683223ae150496144b181156e51d2b32e6b15f8/2026/68xxx/CVE-2026-68501.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-68501.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-68501.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-68501.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-685xx/CVE-2026-68501.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/packagist/sylius/mollie-plugin/CVE-2026-68501.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b4c640370a6a34ea36c82cbaea3c29d7c103902a/content/posts/cve-2026-68501.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2026/CVE-2026-68501.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/f785f3444159263c9afde232b5456d1f01686673/api/2026/CVE-2026-68501.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0977.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0975","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0975.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-68500","title":"Sylius Mollie Plugin 未授权支付状态篡改漏洞","description":"Sylius Mollie Plugin 存在支付状态伪造漏洞（CWE-639），其支付 Webhook 端点 `POST /{_locale}/update-payment` 接受攻击者可控的 `id`（Mollie 支付 ID）和 `orderId`（Sylius 订单 ID）参数，但未验证该 Mollie 支付是否确实属于所引用的订单。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需持有任意有效的已支付 Mollie 支付 ID（例如自己支付 1 欧元订单获取的 ID），即可将其与任意受害订单 ID 组合提交，使受害订单的支付状态被标记为已完成，而无需为该订单实际转移任何资金。Sylius 订单 ID 为顺序递增整数，且该端点无需认证、CSRF 令牌或速率限制，攻击者可批量扫描所有待处理订单进行利用。该漏洞影响 Sylius Mollie Plugin 2.2.8 之前版本及 3.2.4/3.3.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已在 2.2.8、3.2.4 和 3.3.1 版本中修复，修复方式为在 Webhook 处理中校验传入的 Mollie 支付 ID 是否与订单创建时服务端存储的 ID 一致。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-68500","GHSA-rc52-c4hv-w89p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-30T21:18:13Z","updated":"2026-07-31T15:18:01Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Sylius Mollie Plugin v2.2.8（2.x 分支）、v3.2.4（3.2.x 分支）或 v3.3.1（3.3.x 分支），以上版本已在 webhook 中校验 Mollie 支付 ID 与订单的绑定关系。如无法立即升级，可创建装饰器覆盖 `sylius_mollie.controller.shop.payment_webhook` 服务，在调用原始控制器前比对 `id` 参数与订单存储的 Mollie 支付 ID，不匹配时返回 HTTP 200 且不改变订单状态，详见官方安全公告 GHSA-rc52-c4hv-w89p。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/commit/01316b3ad3cf82e3c5ad160115d0a2cf89174e49","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/commit/153c754486b1bc597b67a90ac07ef71cd7958267","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/commit/d1f7753e92106e8bf3bedcfc61b02ea7b8e1c38a","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/pull/351","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/pull/352","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/pull/354","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/releases/tag/v2.2.8","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/releases/tag/v3.2.4","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/releases/tag/v3.3.1","https://github.com/Sylius/MolliePlugin/security/advisories/GHSA-rc52-c4hv-w89p","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2026/68xxx/CVE-2026-68500.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4683223ae150496144b181156e51d2b32e6b15f8/2026/68xxx/CVE-2026-68500.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-68500.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-68500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-68500.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-685xx/CVE-2026-68500.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/c7d5dce5040792ac66f5f987fd2ed030b45edce8/reports/2026-07-30/TIER_2_CVE-2026-68500.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/packagist/sylius/mollie-plugin/CVE-2026-68500.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b4c640370a6a34ea36c82cbaea3c29d7c103902a/content/posts/cve-2026-68500.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2026/CVE-2026-68500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0975.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0975.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0973","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0973.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-68499","title":"Google node-re2 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"re2 正则表达式库的 Node.js 绑定中，`String.prototype.match` 方法在处理全局匹配模式时存在无限循环漏洞。当使用可匹配空字符串的正则表达式（如 `a*`、`b?`、`(?:)` 等）进行全局匹配时，`lib/match.cc` 中的游标推进逻辑未处理零宽度匹配情况，导致匹配位置始终不变，同一空匹配被无限次追加到原生内存向量中，造成无限制的内存增长。该调用为同步原生代码，会阻塞整个事件循环，无法被 `try/catch`、`AbortController` 或内存限制中断，只能通过外部强制终止进程。攻击者若可控制正则表达式模式或输入字符串（如用户提供的正则表达式应用于用户输入的场景），即可远程触发拒绝服务，单次请求即可耗尽主机内存，影响整个服务。该漏洞影响 re2 1.25.2 之前的所有版本，已在 1.25.2 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-68499","GHSA-6hxr-mr5r-9836"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-30T21:18:12Z","updated":"2026-07-31T20:16:54Z","remediation":"立即将 re2 升级至 1.25.2 或更高版本（`npm install re2@^1.25.2`）。如无法升级，避免对可匹配空字符串或受用户控制的正则表达式使用全局模式调用 `String.prototype.match`，改用 `matchAll` 或 `exec` 方法，或使用非全局模式。同时建议在应用层限制正则表达式输入长度和超时时间作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/uhop/node-re2/commit/56293de4fc0914d7bc35f92e98de25b0d9bb417d","https://github.com/uhop/node-re2/releases/tag/1.25.2","https://github.com/uhop/node-re2/security/advisories/GHSA-6hxr-mr5r-9836","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2026/68xxx/CVE-2026-68499.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/68xxx/CVE-2026-68499.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-68499.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-68499.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-68499.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5197f6d88a4fb8976a538beb60d39dd5ad36efed/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-68499.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5197f6d88a4fb8976a538beb60d39dd5ad36efed/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-68499.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-68499.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/re2/CVE-2026-68499.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-684xx/CVE-2026-68499.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0973.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0971","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0971.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67550","title":"Google re2 越界堆读取拒绝服务漏洞","description":"re2 是 Google RE2 正则表达式引擎的 Node.js 绑定库。1.25.2 之前版本中，`lastIndex` 属性在校验时使用目标字符串的 UTF-8 字节长度，但在 `exec`、`test`、`match`、`replace` 和 `split` 方法中却将其作为 UTF-16 码元偏移量使用。当目标字符串包含非 ASCII 字符时，UTF-8 字节长度大于实际字符数，攻击者可通过设置一个介于两者之间的 `lastIndex` 值绕过校验，导致堆缓冲区越界读取，进而触发不可捕获的原生进程崩溃（SIGABRT/SIGSEGV），造成拒绝服务。在部分场景下，越界读取的堆内存数据可能被复制到返回值中，导致有限的信息泄露。攻击者需具备对 `lastIndex` 的控制能力，且正则表达式须使用 `global` 或 `sticky` 标志。该漏洞已在 re2 1.25.2 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67550","GHSA-ff84-5f28-78qj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-30T20:18:15Z","updated":"2026-07-31T23:17:26Z","remediation":"升级 re2 至 1.25.2 或更高版本（`npm install re2@^1.25.2`），该版本已将 lastIndex 校验改为基于 UTF-16 长度而非 UTF-8 字节长度，并增加了缓冲区边界检查。如无法升级，在调用 exec/test/match 前将 lastIndex 钳制为 `subject.length`（字符串长度），且勿将 lastIndex 设置为来自不可信输入的值。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/uhop/node-re2/commit/56293de4fc0914d7bc35f92e98de25b0d9bb417d","https://github.com/uhop/node-re2/releases/tag/1.25.2","https://github.com/uhop/node-re2/security/advisories/GHSA-ff84-5f28-78qj","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67550.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67550.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67550.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67550.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67550.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5197f6d88a4fb8976a538beb60d39dd5ad36efed/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-67550.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5197f6d88a4fb8976a538beb60d39dd5ad36efed/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-67550.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67550.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/re2/CVE-2026-67550.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-675xx/CVE-2026-67550.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0971.toml"}]